{
  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing avgpool aggregation with transformer aggregation in a multiprofile RNA-only model using scvi_n200 encoder, building on prior evidence that multiprofile settings with scvi_n200 improve performance. Validation accuracy (0.653) and F1 (0.628) slightly exceed the previous avgpool baseline (0.650), suggesting transformer aggregation may offer marginal benefits. However, the role of other design choices, such as fusion strategies or alternative encoders, remains uncertain without direct comparative experiments."
}

